wall concourse north_platform
arch concourse north_platform 5
wall ticket_hall north_platform
arch ticket_hall north_platform 4
wall south_platform service
door south_platform service 2
wall service substation
door service substation 2
wall east_link ticket_hall
door east_link ticket_hall 2
wall east_link south_platform
arch east_link south_platform 3

mark attacker_spawn concourse attack "Concourse"
mark defender_spawn ticket_hall defend "Ticket Hall"
mark site track_bed neutral "Tracks"
mark site substation neutral "Substation"

route concourse ticket_hall 2
route concourse track_bed 2
